WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.640
A woman waits at a well before

2
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.760
sunrise. Eight words, and you

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.850
already want to know why.

4
00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:10.689
Open with one scene.

5
00:00:10.689 --> 00:00:13.929
A person, a place, a time of

6
00:00:13.929 --> 00:00:16.489
day. Start in the middle of a

7
00:00:16.489 --> 00:00:18.529
moment, not at the beginning of

8
00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:19.479
history.

9
00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:21.287
Keep it short.

10
00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.647
Four or five sentences.

11
00:00:23.647 --> 00:00:26.147
A scene is a doorway, not a

12
00:00:26.147 --> 00:00:26.947
room.

13
00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.727
Show, don't announce.

14
00:00:30.727 --> 00:00:33.007
The rope, the pot, the queue:

15
00:00:33.007 --> 00:00:34.907
things a reader can see.

16
00:00:34.907 --> 00:00:37.207
"Since time immemorial" is,

17
00:00:37.207 --> 00:00:39.637
strictly speaking, not a scene.

18
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.320
Turn it with one sentence.

19
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.480
A bridge from the scene to your

20
00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.480
topic. This is not only a story

21
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.800
about water.

22
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.180
It is a question about who gets

23
00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:51.980
it.

24
00:00:52.371 --> 00:00:54.051
Say what you claim.

25
00:00:54.051 --> 00:00:55.951
By the end of the first

26
00:00:55.951 --> 00:00:58.011
paragraph, the reader should

27
00:00:58.011 --> 00:00:59.441
know your argument.

28
00:01:01.371 --> 00:01:03.091
Come back at the end.

29
00:01:03.091 --> 00:01:05.731
Return to the woman at the well.

30
00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:08.201
Same scene, new meaning.

31
00:01:10.371 --> 00:01:12.031
For the Essay paper:

32
00:01:12.031 --> 00:01:14.351
two essays, one from each

33
00:01:14.351 --> 00:01:16.671
section, about a thousand to

34
00:01:16.671 --> 00:01:18.891
twelve hundred words each, in

35
00:01:18.891 --> 00:01:20.031
three hours.

36
00:01:20.031 --> 00:01:22.291
Keep the scene short, and make

37
00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:23.841
it serve the topic.

38
00:01:24.453 --> 00:01:27.053
The well was only the doorway.

39
00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:29.463
The argument was the house.
